% holding-blocked: Replace the discovery search with an authorized recording of Umm Kulthum's "Alf Leila wa Leila" (a label, archive or library source). A Grade 4 teacher must trial the line on voices ("loo") and on classroom instruments, the fermata and the soloist's reshaping; a second score reader must check the notation; an Arab music educator must review the tarab and maqam framing and confirm that the E-flat colour of the first draft was rightly removed.
